---
import GitSVG from "../../../assets/brand-git.svg";
import GitLabsSVG from "../../../assets/brand-gitlab.svg";
---

<div class="tech-banner">
  <div class="tech-banner-icon">
    <GitSVG />
  </div>
  <div class="tech-banner-content">
    <h2 class="tech-banner-title">100% open source, 100% open data</h2>
    <p class="tech-banner-text">
      Le code source d'Éclaire et l'ensemble des données collectées sont
      librement consultables. Cette transparence est au cœur du projet : tout ce
      qui est cartographié est public, réutilisable, et vérifiable.
    </p>
    <a
      href="https://gitlab.com/"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener"
      class="tech-banner-link none"
      id="gitlabLink"
    >
      <GitLabsSVG />
      <span>Voir le code sur GitLab</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .tech-banner {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: linear-gradient(
      135deg,
      rgba(43, 72, 136, 0.2),
      rgba(199, 59, 93, 0.2)
    );
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(43, 72, 136, 0.15);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .tech-banner-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 3rem;
    height: 3rem;
    background-color: white;
    border-radius: 10px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: #2b4888;
    margin: auto;
  }

  .tech-banner-content {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .tech-banner-title {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 0.4rem;
    color: #1f2937;
  }

  .tech-banner-text {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #1f2937;
    margin: 0 0 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .tech-banner-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    background: #1f2937;
    color: white;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: background-color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .tech-banner-link:hover {
    background: #111827;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .tech-banner {
      flex-direction: column;
      padding: 1.25rem;
    }
  }
</style>
